<title>UK: Berlin Hannover sets 500 mln mark fungible bond.</title>
<headline>Berlin Hannover sets 500 mln mark fungible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint leads Bankgesellschaft Berlin, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, Dresdner and Norddeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BERLIN HANNOERISHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT   *500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    07.FEB.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.015    PAY DATE   L06.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  27.5 BP   LISTING    BERLIN    L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> NOTES     *FUNGIBLE WITH EXISTING 1.5 BLN MARK DEAL LAUNCHED</p>
<p>		05.DEC.96</p>
<p> MGT/UND    6 BP	SELL CONC  21.5 BP   DENOMS (K)  1</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 50</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
